 "own_rule_reading": [
  "knob values: the Mechanism text states warmup_bars default 12 but gives NO default for entry_frac / stop_frac; the prereg's Data section says params = the file's DEFAULT_PARAMS defaults, so those two VALUES were read from the DEFAULT_PARAMS literal by ast.literal_eval (entry_frac 0.1, stop_frac 0.15, warmup_bars 12 = the prereg's 12); the plugin's logic was not read",
  "bar 0 = the session's first bar (09:30 open, every session in the window); in-session index = position in the day_id run, equal to the clock index (0 intra-session hole bars in this window)",
  "running high / low = max(high[0..k]) / min(low[0..k]) with bar k INCLUDED; range_so_far from the same bars; <= 0 skips",
  "signal bars k >= warmup_bars (12, the 10:30 bar) - so the earliest fill is bar 13 (10:35 open), matching the prereg's first_signal_bar 13",
  "LONG: close[k] >= RH - entry_frac*range AND close[k] > open[0] (strict); SHORT: close[k] <= RL + entry_frac*range AND close[k] < open[0] (strict); open[0] = the session's first bar's open; the two are exclusive via the open[0] test",
  "fill at open[k+1]; a signal on the session's last bar has no k+1 and is not taken; first signal with a fillable k+1 = the session's one trade; no re-entry after a stop",
  "stop = entry_px -/+ stop_frac * range_so_far of the SIGNAL bar k (anchored at the fill price, not at the extreme); fixed for the trade",
  "stop checked intrabar from the entry bar itself (low <= stop long / high >= stop short books the stop price); on bars after the entry bar an open already through the stop books that open (gap-through); a stop touch on the last bar beats the close",
  "no target; exit at the session's last bar close (the session's last bar in the data: 78-bar days at 15:55, early-close / short days at their last bar); the contract's 77-bar time stop (close of entry bar + 77) is applied too but never binds (max hold 64 bars)",
  "booking: gross pts = side*(exit_px - entry_px), cost subtracted per trade, $ on the exit bar's ET session date"
 ],
